{
  "name": "Shopify Competitor Price Drop & Inventory Stock Monitor",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ Shopify Competitor Price Drop & Inventory Stock Monitor\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nTrack product prices, variant SKUs, and out-of-stock signals across any competitor Shopify store on a daily schedule.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/universal-ecommerce-product-price-tracker`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/universal-ecommerce-product-price-tracker) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify Shopify Product Scraper Prices, Stock & SKU** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract, deduplicate, and score live structured JSON records!",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "efcad0bc-d0fc-4b1c-a24a-2df5e472176d",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🔎 Stage 1: Schedule, Target Queries & Apify Extraction\nTriggers daily, sets your target search queries and `maxItems`, and runs the cookie-free **Shopify Product Scraper Prices, Stock & SKU** Actor synchronously via the Apify REST API.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 740
      },
      "id": "8d138a54-83c3-44ec-a6b0-817385a957bb",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 1 Extraction",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🧹 Stage 2: Quality Filtering, Deduplication, Lead Scoring & Export\nFilters verified records, deduplicates by URL/ID, normalizes and scores each record with JavaScript, summarizes the batch, and routes high-priority items downstream.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 980
      },
      "id": "e5cc2e5b-a038-467c-af66-96fe87d22da8",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 2 Processing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        950,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 24
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "244cb7ec-d167-4f9f-a637-41348792ce31",
      "name": "Daily Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        200,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "7178c01f-e477-4a70-a834-62f9e48280a2",
              "name": "queries",
              "value": "[\"gymshark.com\",\"allbirds.com\"]",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "10c726ca-023f-4f94-ae29-34ecfda95536",
              "name": "maxItems",
              "value": 25,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "a41eec60-3177-4446-a3db-39ba6c43730f",
              "name": "pipelineCategory",
              "value": "E-Commerce",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "00ffec57-0271-4742-a411-83e20d8b2aea",
      "name": "Configure Target Queries",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        440,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/laborious_rumor~universal-ecommerce-product-price-tracker/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "token",
              "value": "YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ queries: $json.queries, maxItems: $json.maxItems }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "dd556896-2db3-4422-a4a6-ccffb2fba7dc",
      "name": "Run Apify Shopify Product Scraper Prices, Stock & SKU",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        700,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "64a4b1b7-2050-47cf-a3a9-bf8738ec85f9",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.verifiedStatus ?? true }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "3b6eddd8-0181-48aa-a844-df3d37db33be",
      "name": "Filter Verified Records",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        980,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "compare": "selectedFields",
        "fieldsToCompare": "url, title, recordId",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "3cf6b54b-6ed6-4157-a307-eeeadf61d6fa",
      "name": "Deduplicate Extracted Items",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.removeDuplicates",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1220,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\nreturn items.map((item, index) => {\n  const d = item.json || {};\n  const hasEmail = Boolean(d.email || d.workEmailPattern || (Array.isArray(d.emails) && d.emails.length > 0));\n  const hasUrl = Boolean(d.url || d.website || d.sourceUrl);\n  const qualityScore = (hasEmail ? 50 : 20) + (hasUrl ? 30 : 10) + (d.verifiedStatus ? 20 : 10);\n  return {\n    json: {\n      ...d,\n      normalizedTitle: d.title || d.fullName || d.businessName || d.name || 'Extracted Record #' + (index + 1),\n      primaryUrl: d.url || d.website || d.sourceUrl || '',\n      primaryContact: d.email || d.workEmailPattern || (Array.isArray(d.emails) ? d.emails[0] : '') || d.phone || '',\n      leadQualityScore: qualityScore,\n      priorityTier: qualityScore >= 80 ? 'HIGH_PRIORITY' : 'STANDARD',\n      actorSource: 'universal-ecommerce-product-price-tracker',\n      processedAt: new Date().toISOString()\n    }\n  };\n});"
      },
      "id": "8b4813ec-3682-44a5-a6fa-cdd09c11d895",
      "name": "Normalize and Score Records",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1460,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "0f79f285-e391-46dc-ae8f-46cbbb902877",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.leadQualityScore }}",
              "rightValue": 60,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gte"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2b635e0c-3a08-46f2-a82c-32501cc3e45a",
      "name": "Route High-Quality Records",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1700,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "f032f5de-25d3-438b-abec-df1f3702d263",
              "name": "title",
              "value": "={{ $json.normalizedTitle }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c81a7f5d-755f-452e-a673-9ee24d8ff4de",
              "name": "url",
